```rust
fn set_latitude(lat: f64) -> f64 {
    // Silently clamps out-of-range values!
    if lat < -90.0 { -90.0 } else if lat > 90.0 { 90.0 } else { lat }
}
```

fix:
Return a Result that forces the caller to acknowledge out-of-bounds inputs.
```rust
fn set_latitude(lat: f64) -> Result<f64, String> {
    if lat >= -90.0 && lat <= 90.0 {
        Ok(lat)
    } else {
        Err("Latitude out of range".into())
    }
}
```
